@startuml
title HTTP Request Timing

concise "Client" as C
robust "Server" as S
concise "Database" as D

@0
C is Idle
S is Idle
D is Idle

@50
C is Sending

@100
C is Waiting
S is Parsing

@150
S is Querying
D is Working

@300
D is Idle
S is Rendering

@400
S is Responding

@450
C is Receiving
S is Idle

@500
C is Idle
@enduml
